# Planning docs stay out of the public repo. The README, setup docs and
# EVIDENCE.md are what a reader needs; a working backlog with dated
# post-mortems and unshipped roadmap is for us. Infra config stays tracked.
todo.md

# Runtime ledgers. These are WRITTEN BY THE RUNNING AGENT, so they are state,
# not source. They were tracked until 2026-08-20, and a deploy overwrote
# verdicts.jsonl with the committed snapshot and destroyed eight days of
# decisions including the whole townhall run.
#
# Untracking stops `git pull` and `git checkout`. It does NOT stop
# `git clean -fdx`, a fresh clone, or an rsync --delete, because the files
# still sit inside the deploy directory. Set PROOFSTREAM_LOG_DIR to a path
# outside the checkout on any deployed host — that is the actual fix.
# `pnpm logs:pull` copies them down for evidence generation.
agent/*.jsonl

# Cached oracle suites. Runtime state for the same reason the ledgers above are:
# written by the running agent, one file per milestone, and regenerated on
# demand. Nothing here is source, and a deploy overwriting it would silently
# reset the ruler every evidence comparison depends on.
agent/suites/
